          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: উৎসব",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "উৎসব — utsôb — \"a festival\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "এই গ্রামে বসন্তে একটা বড় উৎসব হয়। ei grāme bôsônte ekṭā bôṛo utsôb hôy. There is a big festival in this village in spring."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "উৎসব (utsôb) is Sanskrit utsava, first 'an undertaking, a beginning' and then 'a festival' (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
