          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "পুজো — pujo — \"a puja; a worship festival\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "পুজোর সময় সবাই নতুন জামা পরে। pujor sômôy sôbāi nôtun jāmā pôre. At puja time everyone wears new clothes."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "পুজো (pujo) is the spoken form of Sanskrit pūjā, 'honour, worship' (Monier-Williams), which the written word পূজা keeps. In Bengal পুজো alone means the great autumn festival."
            }
          ]
        },
